00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:29.650
which means that the bones don't connect.

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:32.750
And sometimes when there's a
displaced fracture like that,

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:34.630
it can put pressure on arteries,

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:36.270
therefore cut off circulation.

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.005
