00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:42.290
from a lack of circulation.

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:44.370
In this case, what the danger would be

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.977
is that the leg would lose circulation

00:01:46.977 --> 00:01:51.180
and necrose from a lack of
oxygenation, not from infection.

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:53.750
So what he's doing is right in a sense,

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:54.820
