00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:41.220
Sexiest doctor saves life on plane,

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:43.100
kid doctor delivers baby in shopping mall,

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:44.570
it's pretty funny on the similarity.

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:46.040
And look, I get that this is a TV show

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:47.230
and it's supposed to
