00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:01.850
This child may know
everything there is to know

00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:04.370
about medicine, probably
more than most other doctors,

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:08.170
but that judgment factor, that
really comes with experience.

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:10.200
- William Johnson, black male, age six,

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:13.630
admitted 5:32am with
cardiomyopathy and failure.

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:16.670
We did a chest x-ray, EKG,
and an echocardiogram.

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.360
He has a murmur of mitral insufficiency.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:21.700
I gave him Digoxin 0.125 milligrams,

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:23.600
Lasix 20 milligrams BID,

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:26.400
and Aldactone 12.5 milligrams BID.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:28.190
Also I'd like to send
him to nuclear medicine

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:29.830
for a cardiac scan at 9:30.

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:31.010
- Thank you, Doctor Howser.

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:33.570
- That was actually a very
legitimate presentation

00:03:33.570 --> 00:03:35.710
of someone who's suffering
with cardiomyopathy.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:37.570
When the heart gets overwhelmed,

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.180
there's a wide variety of conditions

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:41.000
of why the heart can get overwhelmed.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.070
You can develop a condition

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:43.367
known as congestive heart failure,

00:03:43.367 --> 00:03:45.210
where the heart just literally

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:47.440
doesn't pump blood effectively.

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:50.290
In that case, you get a buildup
of fluid around the lungs,

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:51.730
in the lower extremities,

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:53.062
and you need to take medications

00:03:53.062 --> 00:03:55.920
that will help you get
rid of that excess fluid.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:57.840
Now the biggest way to control this,

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:00.900
at least what we do in our
offices outside of medications,

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:02.440
is lifestyle changes,

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:03.730
with one of the most important

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:06.250
being decreasing sodium
intake for these patients.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:08.120
In fact, one of the leading causes

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:10.800
of patients to be
readmitted into the hospital

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:13.510
for a congestive heart
failure exacerbation

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:17.450
is eating take out because
it's so high in sodium.

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:18.300
Isn't that crazy?

00:04:20.558 --> 00:04:22.808
(giggling)

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:27.030
I always have water gun
fights with my patients.

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:29.680
- Well, William, you're not
feeling too well, are you?

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:31.320
- No, sir.

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:32.810
